    "body": "## Goal\nValidate the problem and prioritize work based on real sourcing workflows rather than assumptions.\n\n## Checklist\n- [ ] Identify 10–15 sourcing agents or tender intermediaries to interview.\n- [ ] Ask how they currently normalize buyer requests and compare supplier offers.\n- [ ] Record frequency, time spent, error cost, current tools, and purchase authority.\n- [ ] Demonstrate the current prototype where appropriate.\n- [ ] Record objections and requested outcomes separately from feature ideas.\n- [ ] Seek a small number of serious pilot commitments before expanding scope.\n\n## Definition of done\nInterview notes are summarized without confidential data, and the next product priorities are supported by evidence.",
